OL,3,GNEWSAResidents flooded after quarry
OL,4,Aexplosion told blast work to resume
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents who were evacuated from their
OL,7,Fhomes after a quarry blast forced a
OL,8,Ftorrent of dirty, brown water to wash
OL,9,Fdown a mountainside and flood their
OL,10,Fhomes are anxious it will happen again.
OL,12,FThirteen homes on Heol Berry in
OL,13,FGwaelod-y-Garth, Cardiff, were hit when
OL,14,Fwater from an old iron mine workings
OL,15,Fwas displaced by the planned blast.
OL,17,FKevin Duncan, who is part of campaign
OL,18,Fgroup Stronger Together Lesser Garth,
OL,19,Fsaid it had taken an "emotional toll"
OL,20,Fon residents, leaving them "really
OL,21,Fanxious".
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
